# Page Layout Consistency Rules

## Overview

All pages must follow one of three layout patterns:
1. **List Layout** - For listing/listing pages (operators, nets, branches, infrastructure)
2. **Detail Layout** - For detail/view pages (profile, account, net detail, branch detail)
3. **Homepage Layout** - Special case for dashboard

---

## 1. List Layout Pattern

### Structure
```vue
<template>
  <AppLayout :title="t('nav.resourceName')">
    <div class="space-y-4">
      <!-- Filters Section -->
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
        <!-- Search + Filters + Action Button -->
      </div>

      <!-- Count Display -->
      <p v-if="!isLoading" class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
        {{ t('resource.totalCount', { count: total }) }}
      </p>

      <!-- Separator -->
      <Separator />

      <!-- Content Grid -->
      <!-- Loading skeleton, empty state, or grid of cards -->
      
      <!-- Pagination -->
      <!-- Load More button -->
    </div>

    <!-- Mobile FAB (if applicable) -->
  </AppLayout>
</template>
```

### Header & Breadcrumb
- **Always use**: `AppLayout` with `:title` prop
- **Never set**: `breadcrumb-label` or `breadcrumb-items` (auto-generated)
- **Title format**: Use i18n key from `nav.*` namespace

### Filter Bar Layout
```vue
<div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2">
  <!-- Search: Always first, full width on mobile, flex-1 on desktop -->
  <div class="relative w-full sm:flex-1 sm:max-w-xs">
    <Search class="absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground" />
    <Input
      v-model="search"
      :placeholder="t('resource.searchPlaceholder')"
      class="pl-9"
    />
  </div>

  <!-- Select Filters: flex-1 on mobile, fixed width on desktop -->
  <Select v-model="filter1">
    <SelectTrigger class="flex-1 sm:flex-none sm:w-[120px]">
      <SelectValue />
    </SelectTrigger>
    <!-- ... -->
  </Select>

  <!-- Action Button: Hidden on mobile, visible on desktop -->
  <Button 
    v-if="canCreate" 
    variant="outline" 
    @click="showCreateSheet = true" 
    class="hidden lg:flex ml-auto gap-2"
  >
    <Plus class="h-4 w-4" />
    {{ t('resource.create') }}
  </Button>
</div>
```

**Filter Bar Rules:**
- Search input: `w-full sm:flex-1 sm:max-w-xs`
- Select filters: `flex-1 sm:flex-none sm:w-[WIDTH]` (width: 120px-180px based on content)
- Action button: `hidden lg:flex ml-auto gap-2`
- Gap between items: `gap-2`
- Use `flex-wrap` to allow wrapping on mobile

### Count Display
```vue
<p v-if="!isLoading" class="text-sm text-muted-foreground">
  {{ t('resource.totalCount', { count: total }) }}
</p>
```
- Show only when `!isLoading`
- Use `text-sm text-muted-foreground`
- Place between filters and separator

### Separator
```vue
<Separator />
```
- Always include after filters/count
- No custom classes (uses default spacing)

### Content Grid
```vue
<!-- Loading State -->
<div v-if="isLoading" class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
  <ResourceCardSkeleton v-for="i in 6" :key="i" />
</div>

<!-- Empty State -->
<div v-else-if="items.length === 0" class="py-8 text-center">
  <p class="text-muted-foreground">{{ t('resource.noResults') }}</p>
</div>

<!-- Content Grid -->
<div v-else class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-3">
  <ResourceCard
    v-for="item in items"
    :key="item.id"
    <!-- props -->
  />
</div>
```

**Grid Rules:**
- Loading: `grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3 gap-3`
- Empty state: `py-8 text-center` with muted text
- Content: Same grid as loading
- Gap: Always `gap-3`

### Pagination
```vue
<div v-if="hasMore && !isLoading" class="pt-4 pb-16 lg:pb-0">
  <Button
    variant="outline"
    class="w-full lg:w-auto lg:px-8"
    :disabled="isLoadingMore"
    @click="loadMore"
  >
    {{ isLoadingMore ? t('common.loading') : t('resource.loadMore') }}
  </Button>
</div>
```

**Pagination Rules:**
- Show only when `hasMore && !isLoading`
- Button: `w-full lg:w-auto lg:px-8`
- Container: `pt-4 pb-16 lg:pb-0` (extra bottom padding on mobile for FAB)
- Always use "Load More" pattern, never numbered pagination

### Mobile FAB (Floating Action Button)
```vue
<Button
  v-if="canCreate"
  variant="outline"
  @click="showCreateSheet = true"
  size="icon"
  class="lg:hidden fixed bottom-20 right-4 h-14 w-14 rounded-full shadow-lg z-40 bg-background"
>
  <Plus class="h-6 w-6" />
</Button>
```

**FAB Rules:**
- Only for create actions
- Position: `fixed bottom-20 right-4` (above bottom nav)
- Size: `h-14 w-14 rounded-full`
- Shadow: `shadow-lg`
- Z-index: `z-40`
- Hidden on desktop: `lg:hidden`

### Wrapper Spacing
```vue
<div class="space-y-4">
  <!-- All content -->
</div>
```
- Use `space-y-4` for list pages

