## 2. Detail Layout Pattern

### Structure
```vue
<template>
  <AppLayout 
    :title="t('resource.detail')" 
    :breadcrumb-label="resourceName"
  >
    <div class="space-y-6">
      <!-- Header Section (if needed) -->
      <!-- Resource info, action buttons -->

      <!-- Sections with Separators -->
      <section>
        <!-- Section content -->
      </section>

      <Separator class="my-8" />

      <section>
        <!-- Section content -->
      </section>
    </div>
  </AppLayout>
</template>
```

### Header & Breadcrumb
- **Use**: `AppLayout` with `:title` prop OR custom `title` slot
- **Always set**: `:breadcrumb-label` with resource identifier (name, call sign, etc.)
- **Title format**: 
  - Simple: Use `:title` prop with i18n key
  - Complex: Use `title` slot for custom header (e.g., BranchDetailPage with badges)

### Custom Title Slot (when needed)
```vue
<AppLayout :breadcrumb-label="branch?.name">
  <template #title>
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
      <h1 class="text-2xl lg:text-3xl font-bold">{{ branch?.name }}</h1>
      <!-- Badges, status indicators -->
    </div>
  </template>
</AppLayout>
```

### Action Buttons Placement

**Option 1: In Header (Profile/Account pages)**
```vue
<div class="flex items-start justify-between gap-3">
  <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
    <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold">{{ title }}</h1>
    <!-- Subtitle -->
  </div>
  <Button variant="outline" size="sm" @click="handleEdit" class="flex-shrink-0">
    <Pencil class="h-4 w-4 mr-2" />
    {{ t('common.edit') }}
  </Button>
</div>
```

**Option 2: In Section Header (BranchDetailPage pattern)**
```vue
<section>
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
    <h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
      <Icon class="h-4 w-4" />
      {{ t('section.title') }}
    </h3>
    <Button variant="outline" size="sm" @click="handleAction">
      <Plus class="h-4 w-4 mr-2" />
      {{ t('section.action') }}
    </Button>
  </div>
  <!-- Section content -->
</section>
```

**Action Button Rules:**
- Always `variant="outline"`
- Size: `size="sm"` for section headers, `size="sm"` for header actions
- Icons: Use `mr-2` spacing before text
- Destructive actions: Add `text-red-600 hover:text-red-700` classes

### Section Headers
```vue
<h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
  <Icon class="h-4 w-4" />
  {{ t('section.title') }}
</h3>
```

**Section Header Rules:**
- Always: `text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground`
- Icon: `h-4 w-4` with `gap-2` spacing
- Use flex layout for icon + text

### Section Spacing
```vue
<Separator class="my-8" />
```

**Separator Rules:**
- Always: `class="my-8"` (32px vertical margin)
- Place between every major section
- Never use Card components as separators

### Section Content Patterns

**Info Grid (ProfilePage, AccountPage)**
```vue
<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-y-4 gap-x-8">
  <div>
    <p class="text-xs text-muted-foreground mb-0.5">{{ t('field.label') }}</p>
    <p class="font-medium">{{ value }}</p>
  </div>
</div>
```

**Filtered List Section (ProfilePage memberships, BranchDetailPage members)**
```vue
<section>
  <div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-4">
    <h3 class="text-sm font-medium text-muted-foreground flex items-center gap-2">
      <Icon class="h-4 w-4" />
      {{ t('section.title') }}
    </h3>
    <Button v-if="canAction" variant="outline" size="sm">
      <Plus class="h-4 w-4 mr-2" />
      {{ t('section.action') }}
    </Button>
  </div>

  <!-- Filters -->
  <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-4">
    <div class="relative flex-1 min-w-[200px]">
      <Search class="absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground" />
      <Input v-model="search" :placeholder="t('search.placeholder')" class="pl-9" />
    </div>
    <Select v-model="filter">
      <SelectTrigger class="w-[140px]">
        <SelectValue />
      </SelectTrigger>
      <!-- ... -->
    </Select>
  </div>

  <!-- Content -->
  <!-- Loading, empty, or grid -->
</section>
```

**Filtered List Rules:**
- Search: `flex-1 min-w-[200px]`
- Selects: Fixed width `w-[140px]` or `w-[180px]`
- Filters container: `flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2 mb-4`

### Wrapper Spacing
```vue
<div class="space-y-6">
  <!-- All sections -->
</div>
```
- Use `space-y-6` for detail pages (more spacing than list pages)

### Loading States
```vue
<div v-if="isLoading" class="space-y-4">
  <div class="h-8 w-64 bg-muted rounded animate-pulse" />
  <div class="h-4 w-48 bg-muted rounded animate-pulse" />
</div>
```
- Use skeleton loaders matching content structure
- Placeholder heights match actual content

### No Card Wrappers
- **Never** wrap sections in Card components
- Use direct content with Separators for visual separation
- Only use Card components for list items (NetCard, OperatorCard, etc.)

