## 3. Homepage Layout Pattern

### Structure
```vue
<template>
  <AppLayout :title="t('nav.dashboard')">
    <!-- Optional banner/alert -->
    
    <!-- Desktop Layout (xl breakpoint) -->
    <div class="hidden xl:flex items-stretch gap-6">
      <!-- Main content -->
      <!-- Vertical separator -->
      <!-- Sidebar content -->
    </div>

    <!-- Mobile Layout -->
    <div class="xl:hidden">
      <!-- Stacked modules -->
      <!-- Separators between modules -->
    </div>
  </AppLayout>
</template>
```

### Homepage Rules
- Reuse components from other pages (NetsModule, ActivityFeed, etc.)
- Desktop: Side-by-side layout with vertical separator (`w-px bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-800`)
- Mobile: Stacked layout with horizontal separators (`h-px bg-zinc-200 dark:bg-zinc-800 my-6`)
- Use `hidden xl:flex` and `xl:hidden` for responsive layouts
- Separators: `h-px` for horizontal, `w-px` for vertical

