## Spacing Standards

| Element | Spacing |
|---------|---------|
| List page wrapper | `space-y-4` |
| Detail page wrapper | `space-y-6` |
| Section separator | `my-8` |
| Filter bar gap | `gap-2` |
| Grid gap | `gap-3` |
| Section header margin | `mb-4` |
| Pagination top padding | `pt-4` |

---

## Button Standards

### Variants
- **All buttons**: `variant="outline"` (no solid buttons)
- **Destructive**: Add `text-red-600 hover:text-red-700`
- **Success**: Add `text-green-600 hover:text-green-700`

### Sizes
- **List page actions**: Default size
- **Detail page header actions**: `size="sm"`
- **Section header actions**: `size="sm"`
- **FAB**: `size="icon"` with custom classes

### Icons
- **Always**: `mr-2` spacing before text
- **Size**: `h-4 w-4` for standard buttons, `h-6 w-6` for FAB

---

## Responsive Breakpoints

- **Mobile**: Default (< 640px)
- **Tablet**: `sm:` (≥ 640px)
- **Desktop**: `lg:` (≥ 1024px)
- **Large Desktop**: `xl:` (≥ 1280px)

**Common Patterns:**
- Hide on mobile: `hidden lg:flex`
- Show only on mobile: `lg:hidden`
- Full width mobile, auto desktop: `w-full lg:w-auto`

